{"text":"大魏孝昌三年歲次丁未，五月十四日，所養因緣比丘尼明明勝仰爲七世父母、所生眷屬造釋迦佛一區。願生生世世値佛聞法，願願從心。","tags":[{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"因緣","refId":null,"text":"因緣","start":19,"end":21},{"name":"PersonName","term":"明明勝","refId":null,"text":"明明勝","start":24,"end":27},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"釋迦","refId":null,"text":"釋迦","start":39,"end":41},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"聞法","refId":null,"text":"聞法","start":52,"end":54}]}